Record from cache of a tuned channel: a recording started after its
programme began starts at the programme's start (less pre-padding), as far back
as the channel buffer reaches.  Timeshift option "Record from cache".

tvheadend/tvheadend#2249, commit db71b82b3 (branch record-from-buffer, on master 2e64ec02c).

